From 9241ad7d6607924da792eb3bd2f5253a8e095b29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Andr=C3=A9s=20Villagr=C3=A1n?= <andres@villagranquiroz.cl>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:10:52 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Offer live backgrounds and screensavers from omarchy-ambient

Install > Style > Ambient installs the omarchy-ambient package, and
Remove > Ambient removes it with its settings and downloads. Once it is
installed, Appearance gets a Live Background menu listing its background
sources, and Branding > Screensaver lists its screensaver sources next to
the stock Text Effects, with a Preview. The screensaver launcher hands over
to omarchy-ambient when a live screensaver is chosen. Nothing changes
without omarchy-ambient.
